flowchart LR
    Task[AI or human change contract] --> Search[Search · reuse · extend · compose]
    Search --> Domain[Pure game domain]
    Search --> Presentation[Runtime-specific presentation]
    Domain --> Tests[Seed sweep · solver · invariants · replay]
    Presentation --> Runtime[Modoki / Three.js adapter]
    Runtime --> Build[Compact browser artifact]

    Quality[Machine quality contract] --> CodeGate[Strict types · ownership · debt ratchet]
    Quality --> AssetGate[Recipe · provenance · GLB validation]
    Quality --> UiGate[Six viewports · real interactions · layout]
    Quality --> BudgetGate[Raw · gzip · brotli · JS ratchet]
    CodeGate --> CI[Reviewable reports]
    AssetGate --> CI
    UiGate --> CI
    BudgetGate --> CI
    Build --> CI

    Domain -. forbidden .-> Three[Three.js · DOM · Modoki]
